       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DBG.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. GNUCOBOL WITH DEBUGGING MODE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-I      PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
       01  WS-SUM    PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       DECLARATIVES.
       DBG-SECT SECTION.
           USE FOR DEBUGGING ON WS-SUM WS-I.
       DBG-PARA.
           DISPLAY "DBG name=" DEBUG-NAME " line=" DEBUG-LINE
                   " contents=[" DEBUG-CONTENTS "] WS-SUM=" WS-SUM.
       END DECLARATIVES.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 2
              COMPUTE WS-SUM = WS-SUM + WS-I * 2
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "SUM=" WS-SUM
           STOP RUN.
